  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note-rows",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -190,
      "w": 1400,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Pinged, Receipt direction, twenty-one screens.\nRow 1 first run. Row 2 every day. Row 3 looking back and when it breaks. Rows 4 to 6 the sheets, pickers and lists behind them.\nPopulated scenario is Wednesday 30 September 2026, month end: RM2,847.30 across 112 transactions, RM100.00 of transfers excluded, four items awaiting review."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-rejected",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -130,
      "w": 900,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Directions not taken. Kept as a record of the choice, not for further work."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-paybacks",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8900,
      "w": 1400,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Rows 10 and 11, proposed in #392 and not built: a friend's payback counted against the bill it pays back. Yuen Kee on 18 September is a RM96.00 dinner for three, two RM32.00 paybacks, so its Breakdown line already holds the RM32.00 share. The typed-by-hand boards are pinned to August."
    }
  ],
